  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_11
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_11
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>12 Free Games</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>10 Free Games</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>8 Free Games</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=17>-  Bonus symbol appears on reels 2 and 4.\n\n-  Bonus symbols
      are collected towards\n   one of the 3 re-spin bonuses.\n\n-  During Free Games
      and Mega Free\n   Games, Bonus symbol awards +1 free\n   spin."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_1
    value: '<b><size=20>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1
    value: <style=title><size=27>INSTANT WILD FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=27>LIMITED GIFT FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: "<size=22>-  Instant Wild feature is triggered randomly after each reel
      spin.\r\n-  When triggered, a random number of              appears on symbols
      on reels 2, 3, 4, or 5. \r\n-  Symbols with              become Wild and can
      substitute for all symbols except Scatter\n    and Bonus symbol."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=22>-  Limited Gift feature is triggered randomly during each reel
      spin. \n-  When triggered, Bonus symbols are added to the reels for 10 spins."
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>30 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=27>RE-SPIN BONUSES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=20>-  There are 3 re-spin bonus gauges above the reels representing
      3 features :\n          -  Expanding Reels \n          -  Extra Wilds \n          -
      \ All Wins X2 \n-  Whenever a Bonus symbol appears on the reels, it is randomly
      collected towards one of the 3 re-spin\n    bonuses. \n-  If a gauge gets filled
      with 3 Bonus symbols, trigger the respective re-spin bonus\n-  The re-spin bonus
      lasts for 1 spin, and once the re-spin is complete, the respective gauge gets
      re-set.\n-  If multiple gauges get filled simultaneously, trigger the respective
      re-spin bonuses together in 1 re-spin."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=27>EXPANDING REELS
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: '<size=21>-  When the Expanding Reels gauge gets filled, trigger the Expanding
      Reels re-spin bonus for 1 spin.

      -  During this event, reels expand to 6x5 and number of lines played will also
      increase to 75 lines.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5
    value: <style=title><size=27>EXTRA WILDS
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5
    value: '<size=21>-  When the Extra Wilds gauge gets filled, trigger the Extra
      Wilds re-spin bonus for 1 spin.

      -  During this event, random number of                will be added to symbols.

      -  If triggered simultaneously with the Expanding Reel bonus 10                 will
      be added.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_6
    value: <style=title><size=27>ALL WINS X2
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_6
    value: '<size=21>-  When the All Wins x2 gauge gets filled, trigger the All Wins
      x2 re-spin bonus for 1 spin.

      -  During this event, all wins are multiplied by 2.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_7
    value: <style=title><size=27>FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_7
    value: '<size=20>-  3 or more Scatters triggers Free Games.

      -  Free Games begins with all 3 re-spin bonus gauges already filled with 2 Bonus
      symbols.

      -  Once a re-spin bonus is triggered and completed, the respective event gauge
      re-sets with 2 Bonus symbols.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_8
    value: <style=title><size=27>MEGA FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_8
    value: "<size=21>-  Collect            for each symbol that is part of a line
      win during Base Games. Collecting enough                \n             awards
      Mega Free Games.\n-  Each Mega Free Game triggers 10 free spins and allows the
      player to select one re-spin bonus to be \n   triggered by default whenever
      a Bonus symbol appears. The chosen event will be triggered each \n   time, in
      addition to any other re-spin bonus/es that are triggered randomly.\n-  Mega
      Free Games begins with re-spin bonus gauges already filled with 2 Bonus symbols.
      Event\n    gauges re-set with 2 Bonus symbols once the respective re-spin bonus
      is triggered and completed."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_11
    value: <style=title><size=27>EXTRA BET
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_11
    value: <size=21>- 166% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to activate the Re-spin
      Bonus.
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_9
    value: <style=title><size=27>LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_10
    value: <style=title><size=27>EXPANDING REELS LINES
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Luxury Boutique
  - key: BROCHURE_AVG_BET_AMOUNT
    value: '{0:SimpleNumber}'
  - key: MFG_POPUP_AVG_BET_AMOUNT
    value: '{0:CommaNumber}'
  - key: SIGN_BOARD_GAUGE_SPIN_COUNT
    value: Re-spin!
